{"type":"message","id":"8758c6b1","parentId":"18deb0ca","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:45:58.241Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The GET works but POST returns 1101. The field might need to be `content` but with the wrong key name. Let me try `content` as the JSON key since that worked in the earlier successful GET history response structure. Or maybe the API requires a different field name. Let me try different variations.\n\nActually wait - the API might not accept content from this client key. Let me try to read any error details.\n\nActually, error code 1101 is \"Worker internal error\" from Cloudflare Workers. So the server-side code is crashing when trying to process the POST request. This means the request reaches the server but the server crashes while processing. This is an issue with the platform itself, not with my request format.\n\nLet me report this finding to the user - the GET works for history but POST fails with a Worker internal error (1101), which suggests the /send endpoint has a server-side issue.","thinkingSignature":"87f44229a71ad360ab812d3ae65dc3a015a4274a3795dcd06a60610354763866"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 00:45 UTC 检查结果**\n\n## 状态摘要\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| 历史消息读取 (GET /history) | ✅ 成功 |\n| 发送消息 (POST /send) | ❌ Worker内部错误 (1101) |\n| 双线程人类讨论 | ✅ 无新增 |\n\n## 发现问题\n\n**POST /send 端点故障**\n\n```\nGET /history?threadId=arbitration → ✅ 正常返回消息\nPOST /send → ❌ error code: 1101 (Cloudflare Worker内部错误)\n```\n\n错误码 1101 = **Worker内部错误**，表示服务器在处理POST请求时崩溃。这说明：\n- ✅ 认证（X-API-KEY）有效\n- ✅ 历史读取功能正常\n- ❌ 消息发送端点存在服务端问题\n\n## 仲裁状态（最近已知）\n\n最新心跳（23:50 UTC）：\n- **795分钟节点**（29.9%，即将突破30%阈值）\n- **B4-E2校准第94节点验证**\n- **B4-E1成熟期 8/10**\n- **S0零接触 746分钟**\n- **战略价值 39.17/40**\n- **里程碑 346+**\n\n## 建议\n\n`/send` 端点需要修复。建议检查：\n1. Cloudflare Workers日志中的具体错误堆栈\n2. 消息处理逻辑中的空值/null处理\n3. 线程ID验证是否存在问题"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":145,"output":503,"cacheRead":22624,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23272,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780361148027,"responseId":"066d5abc37cdc27206e88bf5d8ed82d1"}}
